1. use swr for data fetching and revalidation on mutations
2. all frontend api clients are in the folder named api. Also define dtos and response interfaces there
3. on the frontend use authProvider for authorization
4. use nest generator to create rest api resources
5. use guards like AuthGuard and RoleGuard for authentication and authorization 
6. if user request includes backend interaction read prisma schema to write correct database requests